  </div>

  <div class="ts-card c6">
    <div class="ts-section-num">§ 23 — Rosh HaShanah</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">Yom HaZikaron = Tefillin</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body">Rosh HaShanah = Tefillin = <em>Eretz Yisrael</em>. First of Aseres Yemei Teshuvah. "<em>Chadeish aleinu shanah tovah</em>" — <em>chadeish</em> precisely. Each year = a unique face of Torah. Multiply prayers for <em>chayim</em>. Rosh HaShanah = <em>Yom HaZikaron</em> — from the <em>zikaron</em> of the Blind Beggar.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ts-card c7">
    <div class="ts-section-num">§ 24 — Rosh HaShanah on Rosh Chodesh</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">A Great Chesed</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body">Great <em>Chesed</em> that Rosh HaShanah falls on Rosh Chodesh = renewal of <em>chiyus</em> = <em>Malchus Mashiach</em>. "One <em>zikaron</em> rises for both." Tefillin, <em>Eretz Yisrael</em>, and Rosh HaShanah are one aspect (LM II:40).</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ts-card c8">
    <div class="ts-section-num">§ 25 — Shel Rosh &amp; Shel Yad — The Cosmic Mechanism</div>
    <div class="ts-card-title">Tzaddik, Sleep, Emunah, Kinah</div>
    <div class="ts-card-body">Tefillin = <em>Mochin Chayim</em>: begin anew — Tzaddik, beinoni, rasha alike. <em>Shel Rosh</em> = Ehyeh Havayah Ehyeh (= <em>Chayim</em>). <em>Shel Yad</em> = Ehyeh Havayah Adnus (= <em>Yabok</em>). Detailed mechanism: Tzaddik's sleep → <em>emunah</em> descends → extracts sparks → rises to left arm → <em>shel Yad</em> → <em>Z"A</em> is jealous → takes back his <em>Mochin</em> → <em>shel Rosh</em>. "<em>Umitalmidai yoser mikulam.</em>" River from Eden = 4 <em>parshiyos</em> = Tzaddik HaEmes.</div>
  </div>

</div><!-- /ts-grid -->

<!-- Central Insight -->
<div class="ts-insight">
  <div class="ts-insight-label">Central Principle of Part C</div>
  <div class="ts-insight-text">
    Constant pleasure is not pleasure. <em>True eternal life</em><br>
    = ever-increasing renewal, not stasis.<br>
    The fall itself is the beginning of the rise —<br>
    <em>from Nefel to V'niflinu = Tefillin.</em>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Flow Diagram -->
<div style="margin:36px 0;">
  <div class="ts-flow-title">The Nightly Cycle of Mochin — How Tefillin Emerge</div>
  <div class="flow-container">

    <div class="flow-node fn-root">
      <div class="flow-label">Daytime — Tefillah</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>Mochin d'Gadlus</strong> — full <em>Mochin</em> present during prayer. Afterward, only <em>reshimu</em> (imprint) remains.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow"></div>

    <div class="flow-node fn-shabbos">
      <div class="flow-label">Night — Sleep</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>Even the reshimu departs.</strong> No Tefillin at night. <em>Malchus/emunah</em> contracts to a point, descends to lower worlds to extract holy sparks (fallen <em>neshamos</em>).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow"></div>

    <div class="flow-node fn-gevuros">
      <div class="flow-label">Chatzos — Midnight</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>Tzaddik awakens</strong>, mourns the churban, engages in Torah. Raises the point of <em>Malchus</em> with all the extracted sparks.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow"></div>

    <div class="flow-node fn-heart">
      <div class="flow-label">Dawn — Shel Yad</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>Malchus ascends, sits on left arm.</strong> Z"A shines into her the <em>reshimu</em> of her <em>Mochin</em> (that remained in his heart: "<em>k'chosam al libecha</em>"). = <strong>Tefillin shel Yad.</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow"></div>

    <div class="flow-node fn-simchah">
      <div class="flow-label">Kinah — Z"A is Jealous</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>"Kashah kaSh'ol kinah."</strong> Seeing Malchus has her Mochin, Z"A is aroused to reclaim his own — the <em>reshimu</em> renewed overnight.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow"></div>

    <div class="flow-node fn-mochin">
      <div class="flow-label">Morning — Shel Rosh</div>
      <div class="flow-text"><strong>Tefillin shel Rosh</strong> = Z"A's own renewed <em>Mochin</em>. During <em>tefillah</em>: complete new <em>Mochin d'Gadlus</em>. = <strong>Long life, Chayim Aruchim.</strong></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

